								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16024#msg16024"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16024#msg16024">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #15 on:</b> March 30, 2005, 05:49:36 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hello,<br />Eternalruby, officer of Radiant on Quellious here. <br />Just to clarify. We are in the Elementals at this time with a Fennin Ro kill (3rd I believe) and working on GoD and other Elemental gods. <br />Our message board is <a href="http://p199.ezboard.com/bradiance88931" target="_blank">http://p199.ezboard.com/bradiance88931</a><br />I&#039;ve already spoken with fellow officers so perhaps one of them can clarify further if you want :D<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
