	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16065"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1110" title="View the profile of Atlis">Atlis</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 1<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1110"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:atlisbigarms@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16065#msg16065"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16065#msg16065">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #24 on:</b> March 31, 2005, 05:37:19 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							On Quellious you&#039;ve also got the special case of ORQ.&nbsp; An entity which generally raids Tier 1 and Tier 2 PoP, as well as many other targets.&nbsp; ORQ is the small-guild / non-guild collection which gathers for a purpose.&nbsp; It&#039;s not quite pickup, but not quite guild.<br />In the past, there was also URoN, the elemental raiding version of ORQ.&nbsp; That group has dissolved after WoW/EQ2, however, ORQ is still strong.<br /><br />How or would you categorize a non-guild organization?<br /><br />This is also informing all on Rodcet that Quellious is often game for nontraditional raid entities.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
