								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">[How or would you categorize a non-guild organization?<br />/quote]<br /><br />Since this is a top 10 (15 now) GUILDS list, I&#039;d say not at all. That would be like saying how do you classify all the unguilded people who are flagged for elementals, and COULD conceivably band together for a raid.<br /><br />If there is a formal alliance, that is progressing, it will be listed like DA/EiE. Plus, tier 1 and 2 mobs would put them solidly somewhere below the 15 spot anyhow.</div>
						</td>
